# S7 Performance, Memory, and Stability Audit Report

This audit was conducted strictly in **read-only mode** (`FIX_MODE=false`) against [`http://15.235.203.134:9998`](http://15.235.203.134:9998) and the local repository [`/home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app). No source files, tests, package configurations, proof artifacts, or git states were modified.

The structured report has been saved to [`reports/audit/S7.json`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/S7.json) with accompanying test evidence saved under [`reports/audit/evidence/S7/`](file:///home/ubuntu/apps/islamic_app/reports/audit/evidence/S7/).

